{"id":"schlacht","lemma":"Schlacht","pos":"noun","rank":1799,"glosses":["battle","sort, breed","groyne, breakwater"],"ipa":"/ʃlaxt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/De-at-Schlacht.ogg/De-at-Schlacht.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Schlacht","plural":"Schlachten"},"formAudio":{"Schlachten":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Schlachten.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben die Schlacht gewonnen.","en":"We won the battle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/362","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"gained, won"}]},{"text":"Die Schlacht hat gerade begonnen.","en":"The battle has just started.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"to begin","l":"beginnen"}]},{"text":"Die Schlacht dauerte eine Woche.","en":"The battle lasted a week.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to last","l":"dauern"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"week"}]},{"text":"Wir rüsteten uns für die Schlacht.","en":"We prepared for battle.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Viele Soldaten wurden in der Schlacht verwundet.","en":"Many soldiers were wounded in the battle.","words":[{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"soldier","l":"Soldat"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to wound","l":"verwunden"}]}]}